{"speciesId":330,"names":{"fr":"Libégon","es":"Flygon","en":"Flygon","ja":"フライゴン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"FLYGON is nicknamed “the elemental spirit of the desert.” Because its flapping wings whip up a cloud of sand, this POKéMON is always enveloped in a sandstorm while flying."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"FLYGON whips up a sandstorm by flapping its wings. The wings create a series of notes that sound like singing. Because the “singing” is the only thing that can be heard in a sandstorm, this POKéMON is said to be the desert spirit."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"The flapping of its wings sounds like singing. To prevent detection by enemies, it hides itself by flapping up a cloud of desert sand."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It hides itself by kicking up desert sand with its wings. Red covers shield its eyes from sand."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It hides itself by kicking up desert sand with its wings. Red covers shield its eyes from sand."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It whips up sandstorms with powerful flaps of its wings. It is known as “The Desert Spirit.”"},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It whips up sandstorms with powerful flaps of its wings. It is known as “The Desert Spirit.”"},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It whips up sandstorms with powerful flaps of its wings. It is known as “The Desert Spirit.”"},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is nicknamed “The Desert Spirit” because the flapping of its wings sounds like a woman singing."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It is nicknamed “The Desert Spirit” because the flapping of its wings sounds like a woman singing."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son puissant battement d’ailes provoque des tempêtes de sable. On l’appelle “esprit du désert”."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It whips up sandstorms with powerful flaps of its wings. It is known as “The Desert Spirit.”"},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son puissant battement d’ailes provoque des tempêtes de sable. On l’appelle “esprit du désert”."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It whips up sandstorms with powerful flaps of its wings. It is known as “The Desert Spirit.”"},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Known as “The Desert Spirit,” this Pokémon hides in the sandstorms it causes by beating its wings."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Known as “The Desert Spirit,” this Pokémon hides in the sandstorms it causes by beating its wings."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se cache du regard des autres en soulevant le sable du désert avec ses ailes. Une fine peau rouge protège ses yeux du sable."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su medio es el desierto. Para esconderse, levanta arena con las patas. Tiene los ojos protegidos con mallas rojas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It hides itself by kicking up desert sand with its wings. Red covers shield its eyes from sand."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"羽の 羽ばたきで 砂漠の 砂を 巻き上げて 姿を 隠す。 赤い カバーが 砂から 目を 守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On l’appelle « esprit du désert ». Son puissant battement d’ailes provoque des tempêtes de sable qui le dissimulent."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se le conoce como el Alma del Desierto. Levanta tormentas de arena al batir sus alas y se refugia en su interior."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Known as “The Desert Spirit,” this Pokémon hides in the sandstorms it causes by beating its wings."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"砂漠の精霊 と 呼ばれる。 はばたくことで 巻き起こした 砂嵐の 中に 隠れている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Libégon est surnommé « l’esprit élémentaire du désert ». Le battement de ses ailes soulève des nuages de sable. C’est pourquoi ce Pokémon est toujours entouré d’une tempête de sable quand il vole."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"A Flygon se le conoce como el Espíritu del Desierto. Al volar, como levanta una nube de arena al batir las alas, está siempre envuelto en una tormenta de arena."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Flygon is nicknamed “the elemental spirit of the desert.” Because its flapping wings whip up a cloud of sand, this Pokémon is always enveloped in a sandstorm while flying."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"砂漠の 精霊と 呼ばれる ポケモン。 ハネの 羽ばたきで 砂を 舞い上げるため 飛んでいる ときは いつも 砂嵐の 中。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Libégon peut déclencher une tempête de sable en battant des ailes. Les ailes créent une suite de notes ressemblant à une mélodie. Comme cette « mélodie » est le seul son audible, on appelle ce Pokémon l’esprit du désert."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Flygon puede provocar una tormenta de arena batiendo las alas. Estas, al ser agitadas, crean una melodía. Y, como las “melodías” pueden oírse cuando hay tormenta, dicen que es el espíritu del desierto."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Flygon whips up a sandstorm by flapping its wings. The wings create a series of notes that sound like singing. Because the “singing” is the only thing that can be heard in a sandstorm, this Pokémon is said to be the desert spirit."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"羽ばたきで 起こす 砂嵐の 中から 歌声の ような 羽音 だけが 聞こえるため フライゴンは 砂漠の 精霊と いわれた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Le bruissement de ses ailes est très mélodieux. Les malheureux envoûtés par ce chant se retrouvent prisonniers de sa tempête de sable."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Al batir las alas, crea una melodía que atrae a sus presas. Cuando estas se acercan, quedan atrapadas en una tormenta de arena."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"The flapping of its wings sounds something like singing. Those lured by the sound are enveloped in a sandstorm, becoming Flygon’s prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"羽ばたく 羽音は まるで 歌声。 音に 魅せられた者は 砂嵐に 巻き込まれ フライゴンの 餌食に。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Comme il est souvent caché au cœur des tempêtes de sable qu’il déclenche, ce Pokémon n’est que rarement aperçu par l’homme."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Al batir las alas, provoca tormentas de arena que lo ocultan por completo, por lo que rara vez se ha visto a este Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon hides in the heart of sandstorms it creates and seldom appears where people can see it."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"自らが 巻き起こす 砂嵐の 中心に いるので 滅多に 人前に 現れない ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"D’un battement d’ailes, il provoque des tempêtes qui engloutissent les Crocorible. Il partage ses proies avec ses congénères."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Al batir las alas levanta tormentas de arena en las que se esconden los Krookodile, para luego compartir las presas que cacen entre ambos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"By flapping their wings, Flygon cause sandstorms that conceal Krookodile. The team then splits the prey they catch."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"羽ばたきで 砂嵐を 巻き起こし そこに ワルビアルを 潜ませる。 捕まえた 獲物は 分け合うぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il n’est pas rare que des gens se perdent dans le désert après avoir succombé au charme du son mélodieux qu’il émet avec ses ailes."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Muchas personas se han perdido en el desierto tras quedar cautivadas por el sonido que emite al batir las alas, semejante a una bella melodía."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"People continue to have their hearts stolen by its enchanting songs and find themselves stranded in the desert."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"美しい 歌の ような 羽音に 心を 奪われて 砂漠で 遭難する 人が 続出。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Comme il est souvent caché au cœur des tempêtes de sable qu’il déclenche, ce Pokémon n’est que rarement aperçu par l’Homme."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Al batir las alas, provoca tormentas de arena que lo ocultan por completo, por lo que rara vez se ha visto a este Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon hides in the heart of sandstorms it creates and seldom appears where people can see it."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"自らが 巻き起こす 砂嵐の 中心に いるので 滅多に 人前に 現れない ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"On l’appelle « l’esprit du désert », car ses battements d’ailes résonnent comme une mélodie entonnée par une voix douce."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"El batir de sus alas suena como un bello canto de mujer. Se lo conoce como el Alma del Desierto."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It is nicknamed the Desert Spirit because the flapping of its wings sounds like a woman singing."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"はばたく 音が 女の人の 美しい 歌声に 似ているため 砂漠の精霊 と 呼ばれている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":330,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"gust","learns":[[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",9],[6,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",9],[7,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",9],[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",9],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",9],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"le